[00:08.25]1. Look around us now;
[00:16.51]See the love on each face—
[00:21.51]Out there in the world, hard to find.
[00:25.25]All these faithful friends
[00:28.99]With the love they all show,
[00:35.47]Glad to leave that old world behind.
[00:39.09](Pre-Chorus)
[00:42.72]Love never fails; that’s promised.
[00:49.72]It always will endure.
[00:52.72](Chorus)
[00:55.72]Love—unfailing love—
[01:00.72]That’s what Jehovah gives.
[01:02.75]That’s what he is.
[01:04.78]Love—unfailing love—
[01:06.81]That’s what we need to live.
[01:19.81]And the love here today,
[01:25.31]In our heart may it stay—
[01:31.48]Unfailing love.
[01:35.42]2. Though sometimes it seems
[01:39.36]Like the cares of this life
[01:45.36]Weigh us down and feel hard to bear,
[01:52.99]Giving brings us joy
[01:55.99]When we share faith and hope,
[01:58.99]Comforted by God’s loving care.
[02:03.43](Pre-Chorus)
[02:07.87]Love will remain; that’s promised.
[02:14.88]It always will endure.
[02:17.59](Chorus)
[02:20.30]Love—unfailing love—
[02:25.42]That’s what Jehovah gives.
[02:28.37]That’s what he is.
[02:31.32]Love—unfailing love—
[02:34.27]That’s what we need to live.
[02:43.27]And the love here today,
[02:47.27]In our heart may it stay.
[02:51.27](Chorus)
[02:56.27]Love—unfailing love—
[03:01.53]That’s what Jehovah gives.
[03:06.01]That’s what he is.
[03:08.91]Love—unfailing love—
[03:11.80]That’s what we need to live.
[03:19.80]And the love here today,
[03:25.30]In our heart may it stay—
[03:30.80]Unfailing love,
[03:39.00]Unfailing love,
[03:47.19]Unfailing love.